# Arm: qwen — Qwen 3.8 Max, direct DashScope (CN) key, compatible-mode surface.
# Paste into this Mac's credentials.env (replaces the model block).
# VERIFIED 2026-08-06 against Alibaba's first-party model page
# (alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen3-8-max): model id qwen3.8-max
# (rolling alias — no dated snapshot published yet), context window 1,000,000,
# max output 131,072 (max input 991,808). The key is a mainland-China key →
# Beijing endpoint below; an international key would use
# https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1 instead.
# Note: reasoning_effort defaults to "xhigh" — left at provider default
# (we measure the system as shipped).
FB_ARM="qwen"
MODEL_ID="qwen3.8-max"
MODEL_UPSTREAM_URL="https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1"
MODEL_API_KEY=""   # QWEN_CN_API_KEY
MODEL_NPM="@ai-sdk/openai-compatible"
# MODEL_CONTEXT/MODEL_OUTPUT intentionally unset → OpenCode defaults (fleet
# policy: only muse pins limits). Documented caps for reference: 1,000,000
# ctx / 131,072 out.
